# Curated polygenic scores (PGS Catalog, harmonised GRCh37 files). Chosen for genome-wide coverage and good
# performance; scores found unreliable in testing (MultiPRS PGS018408/11/13, which behave as one shared factor,
# and the old Khera scores, which shift strongly with ancestry) are deliberately not included.
#
# show:  'summary' = can appear in the summary table when notable; 'table' = only in the collapsed full table
# strength: how much a 90th-percentile result typically changes risk ('strong' ~1.5-2x, 'moderate' ~1.3-1.5x, 'weak' <1.3x)
# high/low: plain meaning when the percentile is >= 90 / <= 10.  test: doctor-checklist row when high.

